# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the asan preset (cmake/Sanitizers.cmake).
#
# Only what the uninstrumented parts of the process leave behind when it
# exits; never a LiteCGSS / LiteRGSS frame. A suppression matches when its
# pattern is found in a frame's function, module or file name.

# Ruby 3.3: the VM's initial allocation, not freed by RUBY_FREE_AT_EXIT
leak:Init_BareVM
# Ruby 3.3: the root fiber of a thread still alive at exit (PSDK's threads)
leak:rb_threadptr_root_fiber_setup
# Ruby 3.3: the process title buffer
leak:ruby_init_setproctitle
